    --- - `left`: Left side of the screen to the left edge of the region.
    --- - `right`: Left side of the screen to the right edge of the region.
    --- - `bottom`: Bottom side of the screen to the bottom edge of the region.
    --- - `top`: Bottom side of the screen to the top edge of the region.
    --- - `x, y`: Left and bottom side of the screen to the center of the region. `x = (left+right)/2`, `y = (bottom+top)/2`
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_ScriptRegion_GetLeft)
    function GetLeft(): uiUnit
