    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_TextureBase_SetTexelSnappingBias)
    function SetTexelSnappingBias(bias: normalizedValue)
    --- Sets the texture to an image.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `textureAsset`: A FileID or the file path to a texture.
    --- - `wrapModeHorizontal`: If `TextureBase:SetHorizTile` is enabled, sets the wrap behavior for pixels with an x coordinate outside the (0, 1) region of the texture coordinate space.
    --- - `wrapModeVertical`: If `TextureBase:SetVertTile` is enabled, sets the wrap behavior for pixels with a y coordinate outside the (0, 1) region of the texture coordinate space.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `success`: This always appears to returns `true`, even for invalid FileIDs or parameters.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_TextureBase_SetTexture)
    function SetTexture(textureAsset: (string | number | Secret<string | number>)?, wrapModeHorizontal: (WrapMode | Secret<WrapMode>)?, wrapModeVertical: (WrapMode | Secret<WrapMode>)?, filterMode: (FilterMode | Secret<FilterMode>)?): boolean
