    --- `FontString` provides three methods to determine the width of its text independently from the value returned by `Region:GetWidth`: ***GetStringWidth()** ignores `FontString:CanWordWrap` but includes `FontString:IsTruncated` ***GetUnboundedStringWidth()** ignores word wrap and truncation ***GetWrappedWidth()** includes word wrap and truncation
    ---
