    --- - `attributeName`: The name of the attribute (case-insensitive) to be modified.
    --- - `value`: The value to be stored.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Frame_SetAttributeNoHandler)
    function SetAttributeNoHandler(attributeName: string, value: unknown)
    --- Controls how much of the frame may be moved off-screen.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `left`: Left clamp region offset. Controls collision with the left edge of the screen, **positive** values allow the frame to be moved off-screen, **negative** values enforce minimum distance to the edge.
    --- - `right`: Right clamp region offset. Controls collision with the right edge of the screen, **negative** values allow the frame to be moved off-screen, **positive** values enforce minimum distance to the edge.
    --- - `top`: Top clamp region offset. Controls collision with the top edge of the screen, **negative** values allow the frame to be moved off-screen, **positive** values enforce minimum distance to the edge.
    --- - `bottom`: Bottom clamp region offset. Controls collision with the bottom edge of the screen, **positive** values allow the frame to be moved off-screen, **negative** values enforce minimum distance to the edge.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Frame_SetClampRectInsets)
    function SetClampRectInsets(left: uiUnit, right: uiUnit, top: uiUnit, bottom: uiUnit)
    --- Prevents the frame from moving off-screen.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `clampedToScreen`: True to enable clamping, false to permit moving off-screen.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Frame_SetClampedToScreen)
