    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_DurationObject_EvaluateRemainingPercent)
    function EvaluateRemainingPercent(curve: CurveObjectBase, modifier: number?): LuaCurveEvaluatedResult
