    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_IsSearchInProgress)
    function IsSearchInProgress(): boolean
    --- Whether the filter for uncollected decor is on.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_IsUncollectedActive)
