    --- Run search with all current param values
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_RunSearch)
    function RunSearch()
    --- Set the toggle state of all filter tags within a specific group; If active, only entries that match Any of the tags in the group will be included in search results
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetAllInFilterTagGroup)
    function SetAllInFilterTagGroup(groupID: number, active: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, entries that can be placed in house interiors will be included in the search; Note many decor objects can be placed both indoors and outdoors, so having only this toggled on may still include decor that can also be placed outdoors
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetAllowedIndoors)
    function SetAllowedIndoors(isActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, entries that can be placed outside in plots will be included in the search; Note many decor objects can be placed both indoors and outdoors, so having only this toggled on may still include decor that can also be placed indoors
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetAllowedOutdoors)
    function SetAllowedOutdoors(isActive: boolean)
    --- If true, searcher automatically updates results whenever search param values are changed
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetAutoUpdateOnParamChanges)
    function SetAutoUpdateOnParamChanges(autoUpdateActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, includes all owned entries, including those that are in storage OR placed in an owned house or plot; See IsOwnedOnlyActive for a more exclusive toggle
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetCollected)
    function SetCollected(isActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, catalog entries that cannot be customized (ie dyed) will be excluded from the search
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetCustomizableOnly)
    function SetCustomizableOnly(isActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, only the first entry per recordID will be included
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetDistinctPerRecordID)
    function SetDistinctPerRecordID(isActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If set, limits search results to only entries that are used/valid in the specified editor mode
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetEditorModeContext)
    function SetEditorModeContext(editorModeContext: number?)
    --- Set the toggle state of a single filter tag within a specific group
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetFilterTagStatus)
    function SetFilterTagStatus(groupID: number, tagID: number, active: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If set, limits search results to only those within the specified category
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetFilteredCategoryID)
    function SetFilteredCategoryID(categoryID: number?)
    --- Search parameter; If set, limits search results to only those within the specified subcategory
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetFilteredSubcategoryID)
    function SetFilteredSubcategoryID(subcategoryID: number?)
    --- Search parameter; If true, excludes any entries that do not reward house xp when acquired for the first time
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetFirstAcquisitionBonusOnly)
    function SetFirstAcquisitionBonusOnly(isActive: boolean)
    --- Search parameter; If true, only entries that you own, and have instances of available in storage, will be included; This does not include entries that you own but have all been placed in a house; See IsCollectedActive for param that includes placed entries
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetOwnedOnly)
    function SetOwnedOnly(isActive: boolean)
    --- Sets the function called when the search results update.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetResultsUpdatedCallback)
    function SetResultsUpdatedCallback(callback: HousingCatalogSearchResultsUpdatedCallback)
    --- Search parameter; If set, multiple text fields are checked for instances of the text, including name, category, subcategory, and data tags
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `searchText`: Supports advanced search tokens (`'"'` `'-'` and `'|'`), case and accent insensitive; Set nil to clear out the search text
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetSearchText)
    function SetSearchText(searchText: string?)
    --- Sets how the search results are sorted.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetSortType)
    function SetSortType(sortType: number)
    --- Search parameter; If true, includes entries that are not owned, meaning not available in storage nor placed in any owned houses or plots
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_SetUncollected)
    function SetUncollected(isActive: boolean)
    --- Turns the filter for decor allowed indoors on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleAllowedIndoors)
    function ToggleAllowedIndoors()
    --- Turns the filter for decor allowed outdoors on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleAllowedOutdoors)
    function ToggleAllowedOutdoors()
    --- Turns the filter for collected decor on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleCollected)
    function ToggleCollected()
    --- Turns showing only customizable decor on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleCustomizableOnly)
    function ToggleCustomizableOnly()
    --- Turns listing each decor record only once on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleDistinctPerRecordID)
    function ToggleDistinctPerRecordID()
    --- Turns a filter tag of the search on or off.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `groupID`: The filter group the tag belongs to.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleFilterTag)
    function ToggleFilterTag(groupID: number, tagID: number)
    --- Turns showing only decor that gives a first acquisition bonus on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleFirstAcquisitionBonusOnly)
    function ToggleFirstAcquisitionBonusOnly()
    --- Turns showing only owned decor on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleOwnedOnly)
    function ToggleOwnedOnly()
    --- Turns the filter for uncollected decor on or off.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_HousingCatalogSearcher_ToggleUncollected)
    function ToggleUncollected()
end

