declare class UnitHealPredictionCalculator
    --- Calculates the percentage of current unit health and evaluates it against the supplied curve.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_EvaluateCurrentHealthPercent)
    function EvaluateCurrentHealthPercent(curve: LuaCurveObjectBase): LuaCurveEvaluatedResult
    --- Calculates the percentage of missing unit health and evaluates it against the supplied curve.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_EvaluateMissingHealthPercent)
    function EvaluateMissingHealthPercent(curve: LuaCurveObjectBase): LuaCurveEvaluatedResult
    --- Returns the base amount of unit health.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetCurrentHealth)
    function GetCurrentHealth(): number
    --- Returns the percentage of current unit health.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetCurrentHealthPercent)
    function GetCurrentHealthPercent(): number
    --- Returns the configured damage absorb clamping mode.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetDamageAbsorbClampMode)
    function GetDamageAbsorbClampMode(): number
    --- Calculates damage absorb values and clamping according to the configured options.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `amount`: Amount of applied damage absorb affects with potential reductions from clamping included.
    --- - `clamped`: If true, the value is in excess of the clamp boundary.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetDamageAbsorbs)
    function GetDamageAbsorbs(): (number, boolean)
    --- Returns the configured heal absorb clamping mode.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetHealAbsorbClampMode)
    function GetHealAbsorbClampMode(): number
    --- Returns the configured heal absorb processing mode.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetHealAbsorbMode)
    function GetHealAbsorbMode(): number
    --- Calculates heal absorb values and clamping according to the configured options.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `amount`: Amount of applied heal absorb affects with potential reductions from incoming heals and clamping included.
    --- - `clamped`: If true, the value is in excess of the clamp boundary.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetHealAbsorbs)
    function GetHealAbsorbs(): (number, boolean)
    --- Returns the configured incoming heal clamping mode.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetIncomingHealClampMode)
    function GetIncomingHealClampMode(): number
    --- Returns the configured incoming heal maximum overflow percentage.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetIncomingHealOverflowPercent)
    function GetIncomingHealOverflowPercent(): number
    --- Calculates incoming heal values and clamping according to the configured options.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `amount`: Amount of incoming heals across all units with potential reductions from heal absorb effects included.
    --- - `amountFromHealer`: Amount of incoming heals from the healer unit. Will never exceed the all-units value.
    --- - `amountFromOthers`: Amount of incoming heals from units other than theh healer. Calculated as the difference between amount and amount-from-healer.
    --- - `clamped`: If true, the value is in excess of the clamp boundary.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetIncomingHeals)
    function GetIncomingHeals(): (number, number, number, boolean)
    --- Returns the maximum clamping amount for damage absorbs.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetMaximumDamageAbsorbs)
    function GetMaximumDamageAbsorbs(): number
    --- Returns the maximum clamping amount for heal absorbs.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetMaximumHealAbsorbs)
    function GetMaximumHealAbsorbs(): number
