--- Modifies an existing macro.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `macroInfo`: The index or name of the macro to be edited. Index ranges from 1 to 120 for account-wide macros and 121 to 150 for character-specific.
--- - `name`: The name to assign to the macro. The current UI imposes a 16-character limit. The existing name remains unchanged if this argument is nil.
--- - `icon`: FileID - The path to the icon texture to assign to the macro. The existing icon remains unchanged if this argument is nil.
--- - `body`: The macro commands to be executed. If this string is longer than 255 characters, only the first 255 will be saved.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `macroID`: The new index of the macro, as displayed in the "Create Macros" UI. Same as argument "index" unless the macro name is changed, as they are sorted alphabetically.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_EditMacro)
