--- Returns the category number the requested achievement belongs to.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `achievementID`: ID of the achievement to retrieve information for.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `categoryID`: ID of the achievement's category.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetAchievementCategory)
declare function GetAchievementCategory(achievementID: number): number
--- Returns information about the comparison unit's achievements.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `achievementID`: ID of the achievement to retrieve information for.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `completed`: Returns true/false depending on whether the unit has completed the achievement or not.
--- - `month`: Month in which the unit has completed the achievement. Returns nil if completed is false.
--- - `day`: Day of the month in which the unit has completed the achievement. Returns nil if completed is false.
--- - `year`: Year (two digits, 21st century is assumed) in which the unit has completed the achievement. Returns nil if completed is false.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetAchievementComparisonInfo)
declare function GetAchievementComparisonInfo(achievementID: number): (boolean, number?, number?, number?)
--- Returns info for the specified achievement criteria.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `achievementID`: Achievement ID the queried criteria belongs to.
--- - `criteriaIndex`: Index of the criteria to query, ascending from 1 up to GetAchievementNumCriteria(achievementID).
--- - `criteriaID`: Unique ID of the criteria to query.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `criteriaString`: The name of the criteria.
--- - `criteriaType`: Criteria type; specifies the meaning of the assetID.
--- - `completed`: True if you've completed this criteria; false otherwise.
--- - `quantity`: Quantity requirement imposed by some `criteriaType`.
--- - `reqQuantity`: The required quantity for the criteria. Used mostly in achievements with progress bars. Usually 0.
--- - `charName`: The name of the character that completed this achievement.
--- - `flags`: Some flags. See CriteriaTree#Flags.
--- - `assetID`: Criteria data whose meaning depends on the type.
--- - `quantityString`: The string used to display the current quantity. Usually the string form of the quantity return.
--- - `criteriaID`: Unique criteria ID.
--- - `eligible`: True if the criteria is eligible to be completed; false otherwise. Used to determine whether to show the criteria line in the objectives tracker in red or not.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetAchievementCriteriaInfo)
declare function GetAchievementCriteriaInfo(achievementID: number, criteriaIndex: number, countHidden: boolean?): (string, number, boolean, number, number, string, number, number, string, number, boolean, number, number)
--- Returns information about a criterion of an achievement, found by criteria ID instead of by index.
---
--- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
declare function GetAchievementCriteriaInfoByID(achievementID: number, criteriaID: number): (string, number, boolean, number, number, string, number, number, string, number, boolean, number, number)
--- Returns info for an achievement.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `achievementID`: ID of the achievement to retrieve information for.
--- - `categoryID`: Achievement category ID.
--- - `index`: An offset into the achievement category, between 1 and `GetCategoryNumAchievements`(categoryID)
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `id`: Achievement ID.
--- - `name`: The Name of the Achievement.
--- - `points`: Points awarded for completing this achievement.
--- - `completed`: Returns true/false depending if you've completed this achievement on any character.
--- - `month`: Month this was completed. Returns nil if Completed is false.
--- - `day`: Day this was completed. Returns nil if Completed is false.
--- - `year`: Year this was completed. Returns nil if Completed is false. Returns number of years since 2000.
--- - `description`: The Description of the Achievement.
--- - `flags`: A bitfield that indicates achievement properties:
--- - `icon`: The fileID of the icon used for this achievement
--- - `rewardText`: Text describing the reward you get for completing this achievement.
--- - `isGuild`: Returns true/false depending if this is a guild achievement.
--- - `wasEarnedByMe`: Returns true/false depending if you've completed this achievement on this character.
--- - `earnedBy`: Your character name if you've completed this achievement, or the name of the first character to complete this achievement.
--- - `isStatistic`: Returns true/false depending if this is a statistic.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetAchievementInfo)
declare function GetAchievementInfo(achievementID: number): (number, string, number, boolean, number?, number?, number?, string, number, number?, string, boolean, boolean, string?, boolean)
declare function GetAchievementInfo(categoryID: number, index: number): (number, string, number, boolean, number?, number?, number?, string, number, number?, string, boolean, boolean, string?, boolean)
