--- Returns the status of the battlefield the player is either queued for or inside.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: Index of the battlefield you wish to view, in the range of 1 to GetMaxBattlefieldID()
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `status`: Battlefield status, one of:
--- - `mapName`: Localized name of the battlefield (eg. Warsong Gulch or Blade's Edge Arena)
--- - `teamSize`: Team size of the battlefields queue (2, 3 or 5 in an arena queue, or 0 in other queue types)
--- - `registeredMatch`: true in a registered arena queue, or false in a skirimish or non-arena queue; use teamSize to check for arenas.
--- - `suspendedQueue`: (used to determine whether the eye icon on the LFG minimap button should animate, presumed boolean or 1/nil)
--- - `queueType`: The type of battleground, one of:
--- - `gameType`: ??? (displayed as-is to the user on the queue ready dialog, so presumed localized; can be an empty string)
--- - `role`: The role assigned to the player (TANK, DAMAGER, HEALER) in a non-rated battleground, or nil for other queue types.
---
