--- Returns info for an auction house invoice.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: The index of the message, starting from 1.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `invoiceType`: One of "buyer", "seller" or "seller_temp_invoice"; or nil if there is no invoice.
--- - `itemName`: The name of the item sold/bought, or nil if there is no invoice.
--- - `playerName`: The player that sold/bought the item, or nil if there were multiple buyers/sellers involved. Will also return nil if there is no invoice.
--- - `bid`: The amount of money bid on the item.
--- - `buyout`: The amount of money set as buyout for the auction.
--- - `deposit`: The amount paid as deposit for the auction.
--- - `consignment`: The fee charged by the auction house for selling your consignment.
--- - `moneyDelay`: The amount of money that are delayed
--- - `etaHour`: Hour part of the time when delayed auction money will arrive
--- - `etaMin`: Minutes part of the time when delayed auction money will arrive
--- - `count`: Quantity/count of the item in the invoice
--- - `commerceAuction`: True for commerce/commodity auction invoices. Used by Blizzard_MailFrame to hide the purchaser/seller line
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetInboxInvoiceInfo)
