---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: The index of the pet action button you want to query.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `name`: The name of the action (or its global ID if isToken is true).
--- - `texture`: The name (or its global ID, if isToken is true) of the texture for the action.
--- - `isToken`: Indicates if the action is a reference to a global action, or not (guess)
--- - `isActive`: Returns true if the ability is currently active.
--- - `autoCastAllowed`: Returns true if this ability can use autocast.
--- - `autoCastEnabled`: Returns true if autocast is currently enabled for this ability.
--- - `spellID`: Returns the spell ID associated with this ability.
--- - `checksRange`: Returns true if this ability has a numeric range requirement.
--- - `inRange`: Returns true if this ability is currently in range.
---
