--- Gets details on a profession from its index including name, icon, and skill level.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: The spell tab index from `GetProfessions`
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `name`: The localized skill name
--- - `icon`: the location of the icon image
--- - `skillLevel`: the current skill level
--- - `maxSkillLevel`: the current skill cap (75 for apprentice, 150 for journeyman etc.)
--- - `numAbilities`: The number of abilities/icons listed. These are the icons you put on your action bars.
--- - `spelloffset`: The offset id of the first Spell of this profession. (you can CastSpell(spelloffset + 1, "Spell") to use the first spell of this profession)
--- - `skillLine`: TradeSkillLineID - Reference to the profession.
--- - `skillModifier`: Additional modifiers to your profession levels. IE: Lures for Fishing.
--- - `specializationIndex`: A value indicating which specialization is known (ie. Transmute specialist for Alchemist)
--- - `skillLineName`: The expansion variant name, e.g. "Midnight Mining"
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetProfessionInfo)
declare function GetProfessionInfo(index: number): (string, fileID, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, string)
