--- - `index`: Index of the trainer service to retrieve information about. Note that indices are affected by the trainer filter. (See GetTrainerServiceTypeFilter and SetTrainerServiceTypeFilter.)
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `name`: Name of the spell or the header (i.e. "Arcane Explosion" or "Fire").
--- - `rank`: Rank of the spell, if applicable. Headers return empty strings.
--- - `category`: "used" (already have the spell), "unavailable" (can not train this skill), "available" (can train this skill) and "header".
--- - `expanded`: nil if this is a collapsed header (category == "header"), 1 otherwise. (See CollapseTrainerSkillLine and ExpandTrainerSkillLine.)
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetTrainerServiceInfo)
declare function GetTrainerServiceInfo(index: number): (string, string, string, number?)
